<div class="wrap longform"><p class="eyebrow">About / The person behind the code</p><h1>Hi, I'm <span class="accent">Zilu.</span></h1><p>I’m a Pune-based software engineer interested in full-stack web development, AI agents, developer experience and resilient systems.</p><p>My public work includes JavaScript and Node.js projects, Cloudflare Workers automation, event-driven microservices and open-source integrations.</p><h2>How I approach software</h2><p>I prefer practical architecture, readable code, sensible performance trade-offs, and tools that solve real problems. I also enjoy experimenting with AI workflows and sharing what I learn.</p><h2>Outside the code</h2><p>I enjoy mentoring, writing technical notes and contributing to developer communities.</p><h2>Get in touch</h2><p><a href="mailto:zilurrane@gmail.com" class="btn primary">Email me ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/zilurrane" class="btn">GitHub ↗</a></p></div></Base>